flowchart TD
    A[Cliente/Aplicación] -->|SOAP Request<br/>consultaOfertaCreditoConsumo| B[ConsultaOfertaCreditoConsumo.proxy]

    B --> C[ConsultaOfertaCreditoConsumo.pipeline<br/>Router Principal]

    C --> D[Stage: ValidacionXSD]
    D -->|Validación XSD contra<br/>consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoTypes.xsd| E{XSD Válido?}

    E -->|No| F[Error Handler Global]
    F --> G[wsCallout MapeoErrores]
    G --> H[Reply ERROR al Cliente]

    E -->|Sí| I[Stage: ConsultaRutaRegional]
    I -->|wsCallout consultaRutaRegional_db<br/>ServiceId: FICBCO0399<br/>Version: V2| J{PV_CODIGO_ERROR = SUCCESS?}

    J -->|No| K[Reply ERROR:<br/>PV_MENSAJE_ERROR]

    J -->|Sí| L[Obtener $ubicacion =<br/>PV_UBICACION]
    L --> M{Dynamic Route<br/>por $ubicacion}

    %% ========== FLUJO HN ==========
    M -->|HN01: ConsultaOfertaCreditoConsumoHN| N[Pipeline HN]

    N --> N1[Stage: Obtener Identidad]
    N1 -->|$identidad = CUSTOMER_INFO/ID| N2[Stage: ConsultaConsolidadaRiesgoCliente]

    N2 -->|wsCallout<br/>XQ: consultaConsolidadoRiesgoClienteIn.xqy<br/>Param: customerLegalID| N2A[ConsultaConsolidadaRiesgoClienteHN]
    N2A -->|$RESConsultaConsRiesgoCliente| N3[Stage: ObtenerToken]

    N3 -->|wsCallout<br/>TokenizacionProcesamientoBlazeProxyService| N3A{tokenApi != '' ?}

    N3A -->|No| N3B[$ErrorCode = 'Error']
    N3B --> N5[Response: ProcesamientoSalida]

    N3A -->|Sí| N4[Stage: ProcesamientoEntradaCloud]
    N4 -->|Header: Authorization Bearer $tokenApi<br/>XQ: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoCloudIn.xqy<br/>Params: request + riesgoCliente| N4A[wsCallout blazeCloudApiRestBS<br/>Op: epOriginacionesHonduras<br/>URL: https://app.dms.uset2.ficoanalyticcloud.com/...]

    N4A -->|Error HTTP| N4B[Error Handler:<br/>$ErrorCode = http-response-code<br/>resume]
    N4B --> N5

    N4A -->|Exitoso| N4C[$RSPBlazeCloudApi]
    N4C --> N5

    N5 --> N5A{$ErrorCode existe?}
    N5A -->|Sí| N5B[Response ERROR<br/>401: Token inválido<br/>503: Servicio no disponible<br/>Error: No se obtuvo token<br/>Otro: Error general HTTP]

    N5A -->|No| N5C[XQ: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoCloudOut.xqy<br/>→ consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoResponse<br/>Header: Success]
    N5C --> N6[Stage: Almacenar Oferta]

    N6 -->|publish fire-and-forget<br/>XQ: almacenaInformacionHondurasIN.xqy<br/>Params: xml=serialize, identidad| N6A[AlmacenaInformacionOfertaHonduras_db<br/>Conexión: ConnectionCustomerCreditRisk<br/>Schema: CREDITOS_RIESGOS<br/>Package: HN_ONBASE<br/>SP: AlmacenaInformacionOfertaHonduras]

    N5B --> N7[Response al Router]
    N6 --> N7

    %% ========== FLUJO GT ==========
    M -->|GT01: ConsultaOfertaCreditoConsumoGT| O[Pipeline GT]

    O --> O1[Stage: ObtenerToken]
    O1 -->|wsCallout<br/>TokenizacionProcesamientoBlaze| O1A{successIndicator = SUCCESS?}

    O1A -->|No| O1B[$validationMessage = messages]
    O1B --> O3[Response: ProcesamientoSalida]

    O1A -->|Sí| O2[Stage: OriginacionesGT]
    O2 -->|$token = RSP/TOKEN<br/>XQ: processWithDecisionFlow2In.xqy<br/>Params: request + token<br/>Campos: consultaTuca, referencias,<br/>antiguedades=0, estados=0| O2A[wsCallout originacionesGT<br/>Op: processWithDecisionFlow2<br/>URL: https://oic.ocservices.ficohsa.com/.../EPORIGINACIONESG_SOAP/1.0/<br/>Auth: HTTP Basic DEVCLOUD]

    O2A -->|$RSPprocessWithDecisionFlow2| O3

    O3 --> O3A{auditSteps type=ERROR<br/>en respuesta?}
    O3A -->|No| O3B[XQ: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoGTOut.xqy<br/>→ consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoResponse<br/>Header: Success]
    O3A -->|Sí| O3C[Response ERROR:<br/>messages = stepMessage de<br/>cada auditStep ERROR]

    O3B --> O4[Response al Router]
    O3C --> O4

    %% ========== RESPONSE COMÚN ==========
    N7 --> P[Router Response Pipeline]
    O4 --> P

    P --> P1{successIndicator = SUCCESS?}
    P1 -->|Sí| P2[Pass-through]
    P1 -->|No| P3[wsCallout MapeoErrores<br/>FICBCO0399 + messages]
    P3 --> P4[Header normalizado]

    P2 --> Q[SOAP Response al Cliente]
    P4 --> Q
